            <history xml:id="history_1dfcb8a8">
               <p xml:id="idm212">The work is written between 1853, when Hans Christian Andersen published the text for no. 2 and the death of Emil Erslev in 1881. It was originally written for equal voices, but later a version for mixed choir was added. Only the names of the instruments are mentioned, but the parts have not survived. </p>
